// A product file built on the published library
// Shows: the other side of a release: a new file that adds the library, imports its components, fills a dense page with instances (table header and rows at the xs size, header labels set by property), styles its few own layers with library text styles and library variables instead of local copies, switches a copy to Gray 100 with the library collections, and asks for updates
// then: run from the examples folder after script 54; the path below points at its output
// Nothing in this file is drawn twice: components, text styles and variables all come from the library, linked and read-only.
